From 3637da129d1b7a75410068cb74f96a2c202e2df5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AF9 <af9@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:25:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fusion reactors: no start buffer, constant auxiliary power (4
 A standby, 1 A running) instead (7.5.3-af9.8)

- FusionReactorMachine: the internal start energy buffer and the heat are gone. The reactor draws a standby power every tick it
  is not running (4 A of LuV; UV for a reactor above the Mk3, the Mega Fusion Reactor) and 1 A while a reaction runs, from the
  auxiliary hatches, else from the primary ones. Without it the reactor is not ready, no reaction starts, and a running one is lost.
- A recipe's eu_to_start is only a class gate now: up to 160 M / 320 M / 640 M for the Mk1 / Mk2 / Mk3 and the Mega (at most 640 M).
- The controller screen shows ready / offline and the auxiliary amperage.
